@startuml

title Fluxo de Autenticação e Criação de Ordem de Serviço

actor Usuario

participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "Lambda Auth" as LAMBDA
database "RDS PostgreSQL" as RDS
participant "FastAPI App (EKS)" as FASTAPI
participant "JWT Middleware" as JWT
participant "Service Order API" as SOAPI
participant "Datadog Agent" as DDAGENT
participant "Datadog" as DD

== Autenticação ==

Usuario -> APIGW : POST /login\nCPF

APIGW -> LAMBDA : Encaminha request

LAMBDA -> RDS : SELECT client by CPF

RDS --> LAMBDA : Cliente válido

LAMBDA -> LAMBDA : Gerar JWT (HS256)

LAMBDA --> APIGW : JWT

APIGW --> Usuario : 200 OK + Token

== Criação de Ordem de Serviço ==

Usuario -> APIGW : POST /api/service-orders\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT

APIGW -> FASTAPI : Encaminha request

FASTAPI -> JWT : Validar JWT

JWT -> JWT : Verifica assinatura/token

JWT --> FASTAPI : CPF autorizado

FASTAPI -> SOAPI : Criar ordem serviço

SOAPI -> RDS : INSERT service_order

RDS --> SOAPI : Ordem criada

SOAPI --> FASTAPI : Success

par Logs Estruturados

    FASTAPI -> DDAGENT : JSON Logs

else Tracing

    FASTAPI -> DDAGENT : Traces / Spans

end

DDAGENT -> DD : Logs + Traces + Métricas

DD --> DD : APM / Monitoring / Alerts

FASTAPI --> APIGW : 201 Created

APIGW --> Usuario : Ordem criada

@enduml
